# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# FLEETMARK / SSBS — Environment template
#
# Usage:   cp .env.example .env   then edit the values below.
# This file is committed as a reference. The real .env is gitignored — never
# commit secrets. All secret values here are placeholders for local dev only.
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# ── Database (PostgreSQL) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Consumed by: docker-compose.yml (db service), vault/scripts/init.sh, settings.py
# The db container listens on 5432 internally; docker-compose maps it to 5433 on
# the host. DB_HOST/DB_PORT below are the *internal* address the backend uses.
POSTGRES_DB=ssbs_db
POSTGRES_USER=ssbs_user
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change-me-local-db-password
DB_HOST=db
DB_PORT=5432

# ── Django core ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Consumed by: vault/scripts/init.sh (seeds Vault secret/ssbs/django), settings.py
# Generate a real key for anything non-local:
#   python -c "from django.core.management.utils import get_random_secret_key; print(get_random_secret_key())"
SECRET_KEY=change-me-django-secret-key
APP_DEBUG=true
ALLOWED_HOSTS=*
# Where the backend redirects the browser after 42 OAuth (through the WAF).
FRONTEND_URL=https://localhost:8443

# ── JWT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Seeded into Vault by vault/scripts/init.sh (secret/ssbs/jwt). SimpleJWT itself
# signs with SECRET_KEY; these are kept for reference/rotation.
JWT_SECRET=change-me-jwt-secret
JWT_EXPIRATION=24h

# ── 42 Intra OAuth ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Consumed by: settings.py, apps/users/views.py, vault/scripts/init.sh.
# Leave CLIENT_ID / CLIENT_SECRET blank to keep "Login with 42" disabled.
# Register the exact REDIRECT_URI below on your 42 application page.
# ADMIN_42_LOGIN: the 42 login that is auto-promoted to LOGISTICS_STAFF on login.
INTRA_42_CLIENT_ID=
INTRA_42_CLIENT_SECRET=
INTRA_42_REDIRECT_URI=https://localhost:8443/api/v1/auth/42/callback/
ADMIN_42_LOGIN=

# ── Public API key ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Consumed by: settings.py (SSBS_API_KEY), apps/users/permissions.py (X-API-Key).
SSBS_API_KEY=change-me-public-api-key

# ── ELK stack ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Consumed by: docker-compose.yml (elasticsearch/logstash/kibana). Only needed
# when starting the ELK services (make elk-up); their TLS certs are generated
# automatically by the elk-cert-init container.
ELASTIC_PASSWORD=change-me-elastic-password
